1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:02,343
Seventeen hours free this week.

2
00:00:02,383 --> 00:00:04,637
Thirteen and a half hours of work.

3
00:00:04,677 --> 00:00:08,029
It looks fine, until one task has to wait for another.

4
00:00:08,069 --> 00:00:13,877
In this synthetic example, every deadline is met in only fifty-one percent of simulated weeks.

5
00:00:15,101 --> 00:00:17,242
Daylight gives every task a range.

6
00:00:17,282 --> 00:00:21,516
The essay could take three hours, probably four and a half, maybe seven.

7
00:00:21,556 --> 00:00:25,459
It can't start until the argument is shaped, and it's due Friday.

8
00:00:25,499 --> 00:00:30,470
Daylight plays out sixteen hundred possible weeks, inside the hours I actually have.

9
00:00:31,702 --> 00:00:34,464
So what if I narrow the essay by thirty percent?

10
00:00:34,504 --> 00:00:37,717
Same random draws. One changed assumption.

11
00:00:37,757 --> 00:00:41,610
Now ninety-four percent of simulated weeks meet every deadline.

12
00:00:41,650 --> 00:00:46,249
That's a simulation, not a promise, and the quality trade-off is still mine.

13
00:00:47,404 --> 00:00:51,595
In the changed schedule, the essay finishes on Thursday instead of Friday.

14
00:00:51,635 --> 00:00:56,363
Adding a two-hour work block on Wednesday instead reaches ninety-six percent.

15
00:00:56,403 --> 00:01:00,462
Starting the problem set a day earlier doesn't move the number at all.

16
00:01:00,502 --> 00:01:02,872
The essay chain is still what's at risk.

17
00:01:04,105 --> 00:01:05,544
Back to the scope cut.

18
00:01:05,584 --> 00:01:11,395
Export a replay, and the plan, the change, the seed and the engine version travel together.

19
00:01:11,435 --> 00:01:14,898
Import it, and every result is recomputed locally.

20
00:01:14,938 --> 00:01:17,108
Nobody has to trust a screenshot.

21
00:01:18,307 --> 00:01:22,280
The model is open: what the numbers mean, and what they leave out.

22
00:01:22,320 --> 00:01:25,200
No account. No calendar access.

23
00:01:25,240 --> 00:01:27,848
No AI guessing how productive I am.

24
00:01:27,888 --> 00:01:32,210
Just a clear question: which small change gives this week some breathing room?
